## An ECS task definition of the family mamela-<boundary>-<name>. A change registers a new revision and deregisters the old one.
##
## `boundary`: the boundary (the guard's): the family is mamela-<boundary>-<name>
## `launch`: where its tasks run: FARGATE (Fargate and Fargate Spot; awsvpc) or EC2 (container instances; bridge)
## `cpu`: CPU units, 1024 to a vCPU
## `memory_mi_b`: memory in MiB
